    "topic": "Nature of Radio Waves",
    "question": "Radio waves are a form of:",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "a",
        "text": "Electromagnetic radiation"
      },
      {
        "id": "b",
        "text": "Mechanical vibration"
      },
