        "text": "Thermal conduction"
      },
      {
        "id": "d",
        "text": "Sound waves"
      }
    ],
    "correct": "a",
    "explanation": "When alternating current at high frequency flows in a wire, energy travels outward as electromagnetic radiation, i.e. radio waves.",
